easurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"observations-variables-and-values\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 3 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 3 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 3 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Dataset-এর basic grammar শিখুন: প্রতিটি observation একটি entity বা event, প্রতিটি variable একটি characteristic এবং প্রতিটি cell-এ একটি value থাকে।\" data-en=\"Learn the basic grammar of a dataset: each observation represents an entity or event, each variable records a characteristic, and each cell contains a value.\">Learn the basic grammar of a dataset: each observation represents an entity or event, each variable records a characteristic, and each cell contains a value.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 35 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Dataset-এ observation identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify observations in a dataset.\">Identify observations in a dataset.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Variable ও value আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish variables from values.\">Distinguish variables from values.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Appropriate unit of observation বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose an appropriate unit of observation.\">Choose an appropriate unit of observation.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Identifier ও measure চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize identifiers and measures.\">Recognize identifiers and measures.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Observation\" data-en=\"Observation\">Observation</h2><p data-bn=\"Observation হলো একটি recorded case। এটি person, order, product, visit, day, transaction বা machine reading হতে পারে। Table-এর unit of observation consistent হতে হবে। একটি row order এবং অন্য row customer total হলে level mix হয়।\" data-en=\"An observation is one recorded case. It may represent a person, order, product, visit, day, transaction, or machine reading. The unit of observation must be consistent within a table. If one row is an order and another row is a customer total, the table mixes levels and becomes difficult to analyze.\">An observation is one recorded case. It may represent a person, order, product, visit, day, transaction, or machine reading. The unit of observation must be consistent within a table. If one row is an order and another row is a customer total, the table mixes levels and becomes difficult to analyze.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Variable\" data-en=\"Variable\">Variable</h2><p data-bn=\"Variable হলো characteristic যা observation অনুযায়ী vary করে: age, district, revenue, date বা satisfaction rating। Variable-এর definition, unit, allowed value ও role থাকে। Operational definition document না করলে একই word-এর meaning ভিন্ন হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"A variable is a characteristic that can vary across observations: age, district, revenue, date, or satisfaction rating. Variables have definitions, units, allowed values, and roles. The same word can mean different things unless its operational definition is documented.\">A variable is a characteristic that can vary across observations: age, district, revenue, date, or satisfaction rating. Variables have definitions, units, allowed values, and roles. The same word can mean different things unless its operational definition is documented.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Value ও identifier\" data-en=\"Value and identifier\">Value and identifier</h2><p data-bn=\"Value হলো একটি variable ও observation-এর recorded entry। Identifier observation আলাদা করে, যেমন order_id। Identifier numerical দেখালেও সাধারণত categorical; customer ID average অর্থহীন।\" data-en=\"A value is the recorded entry for one variable and observation. An identifier distinguishes observations, such as order_id. An identifier may look numerical but is usually categorical: averaging customer IDs is meaningless.\">A value is the recorded entry for one variable and observation. An identifier distinguishes observations, such as order_id. An identifier may look numerical but is usually categorical: averaging customer IDs is meaningless.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Observation\" data-en=\"Observation\">Observation</h3><p data-bn=\"একটি row দ্বারা represented entity বা event।\" data-en=\"One entity or event represented by a row.\">One entity or event represented by a row.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Variable\" data-en=\"Variable\">Variable</h3><p data-bn=\"Observation-এর জন্য measured বা recorded characteristic।\" data-en=\"A characteristic measured or recorded for observations.\">A characteristic measured or recorded for observations.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Value\" data-en=\"Value\">Value</h3><p data-bn=\"Observation ও variable-এর intersection-এর entry।\" data-en=\"The entry at the intersection of an observation and variable.\">The entry at the intersection of an observation and variable.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Identifier\" data-en=\"Identifier\">Identifier</h3><p data-bn=\"Record uniquely distinguish করার field।\" data-en=\"A field used to uniquely distinguish records.\">A field used to uniquely distinguish records.</p><small class=\"term-example\" data-bn=\"order_id = ORD-1008\" data-en=\"order_id = ORD-1008\">order_id = ORD-1008</small></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Customer-order table\" data-en=\"Customer-order table\">Customer-order table</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একটি table-এ order_id, order_date, customer_id, city, quantity ও revenue আছে।\" data-en=\"A table contains order_id, order_date, customer_id, city, quantity, and revenue.\">A table contains order_id, order_date, customer_id, city, quantity, and revenue.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"“Order” unit of observation হিসেবে বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose “order” as the unit of observation.\">Choose “order” as the unit of observation.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি row একটি order represent করবে।\" data-en=\"Each row should represent one order.\">Each row should represent one order.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"order_id identifier।\" data-en=\"order_id is the identifier.\">order_id is the identifier.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"city categorical; quantity ও revenue numerical variable।\" data-en=\"city is a categorical variable; quantity and revenue are numerical variables.\">city is a categorical variable; quantity and revenue are numerical variables.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Quantity-এর নিচে 3 value একটি specific order-এর।\" data-en=\"The value 3 under quantity belongs to one particular order.\">The value 3 under quantity belongs to one particular order.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Clear row meaning accidental double counting ও invalid aggregation prevent করে।\" data-en=\"Clear row meaning prevents accidental double counting and invalid aggregation.\">Clear row meaning prevents accidental double counting and invalid aggregation.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Row observation represent করে।\" data-en=\"Rows represent observations.\">Rows represent observations.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Column variable represent করে।\" data-en=\"Columns represent variables.\">Columns represent variables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Cell value ধারণ করে।\" data-en=\"Cells contain values.\">Cells contain values.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Unit of observation consistent রাখতে হয়।\" data-en=\"The unit of observation must stay consistent.\">The unit of observation must stay consistent.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-1-definitions-of-statistics-probability-and-key-terms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Definitions of Statistics, Probability, and Key Terms ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}